First year residents (living in a traditional Residence Hall): No kitchen? No problem! Choose from the Comet Unlimited, 14 or 10, whichever fits your lifestyle the best! Per your Housing contract, all first year residents are required to choose one of the Comet meal plan options, check them out on our Meal Plans Page.

