WHY
College is stressful enough; let us take care of the food! We are open throughout the week during high traffic times to fit your busy schedule and get you the nutrients you need! Plus, cooking in a small microwave will get really boring (and expensive with pre-made dinners) really fast. Come join your friends for lunch in the Comet Café or Student Union Food Court, or bring your student organization to dinner in the Dining Hall and chat away while eating however much you want.

